ok forward to further communication. Email us at syedatif@devcorpinternationalbh.com or Visit https://devcorpinternational.com\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\nSyed Atif\r\nExecutive Investment Director\r\nDevcorp International W.L.L.','2024-05-23 09:45:39','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(188,34,'_forminator_user_ip','209.97.131.238','2024-05-23 09:45:39','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(189,35,'name-1','Michael Longsdon','2024-05-25 04:28:35','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(190,35,'email-1','info@elderfreedom.net','2024-05-25 04:28:35','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(191,35,'select-1','Home Intravenous Therapy Services','2024-05-25 04:28:35','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(192,35,'textarea-1','Hello!\r\n\r\nCaring for someone from a distance can become increasingly challenging as their needs evolve over time. Recognizing the signs that indicate the need to relocate closer to your loved one when remote caregiving is no longer practical can be crucial.\r\n\r\nI am eager to share an article with you that delves into this topic and also offers strategies to facilitate a smoother transition for everyone involved. Would you be interested in featuring this piece as a guest post on your website? If so, please let me know, and I will send over the final draft for your review.\r\n\r\nThanks, and have a great day!\r\nMike Longsdon\r\nElderFreedom.net\r\n\r\n\r\nP.S. By the way, if you don’t like the suggested topic, do reach out to me with a topic that’s a better fit for your website. If you don’t want to hear from me again, please let me know.','2024-05-25 04:28:35','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(193,35,'_forminator_user_ip','191.102.139.203','2024-05-25 04:28:35','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(194,36,'name-1','Brocton Zimer','2024-05-25 14:25:18','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(195,36,'email-1','info@sxanpro.com','2024-05-25 14:25:18','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(196,36,'phone-1','(616) 307-0462','2024-05-25 14:25:18','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(197,36,'select-1','Medication Management','2024-05-25 14:25:18','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(198,36,'textarea-1','Hi 