m, you are encouraged to give it away to others who will benefit. I provide free consultation to all who use the program.  Write questions to: davidb@se-rem.com. Se-REM.com has a 95% rating on Trustpilot.  It is in use in 33 countries. \r\n\r\nNo subscriptions asked for. This email is a one-time occurrence.\r\n\r\nI wish you well,  \r\nDavid B., LCSW  (retired trauma therapist). \r\n\r\nP.S: You may wish to save this email for future reference.   This announcement is a public service for a not-for-profit program that has saved and restored lives shattered by abuse and trauma.','2024-08-08 11:38:37','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(823,142,'_forminator_user_ip','149.88.18.9','2024-08-08 11:38:37','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(824,143,'name-1','Charles Pace','2024-08-08 20:49:41','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(825,143,'email-1','charles@commercialcleanrsla.com','2024-08-08 20:49:41','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(826,143,'phone-1','(424) 377-2767','2024-08-08 20:49:41','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(827,143,'select-1','PT/OT/SLP Therapy','2024-08-08 20:49:41','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(828,143,'textarea-1','I was checking out your company and wanted to say thank you for your help in our community.\r\n\r\nAs a small thank you, would it help you out if I provided a no-obligation cleaning estimate for you?\r\n\r\nCharles Pace\r\nPresident\r\nCommercial Cleanrs LA\r\ncharles@commercialcleanrsla.com\r\n\r\nRespond with stop to optout.','2024-08-08 20:49:41','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(829,143,'_forminator_user_ip','110.38.253.16','2024-08-08 20:49:41','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(830,144,'name-1','JerrymaM','2024-08-09 00:00:33','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(831,144,'email-1','lichtindianerin@gmx.de','2024-08-09 00:00:33','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(832,144,'phone-1','84115754267','2024-08-09 00:00:33','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(833,144,'select-1','PT/OT/SLP Therapy','2024-08-09 00:00:33','0000-00-00 00:00:00'),(834,144,'textarea-1','CRYPTO OPTIONS FOR ADVANCED INVESTORS: $50,000 WEEKLY PASSIVE INCOME http://rankup.org/?wptouch_swit