id\":\"d155d5c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Founded in 2017 in the heart of Los Angeles,\\u00a0<strong>Mobile Medical LA<\\/strong>\\u00a0is a vision of expert home health nurses who saw the growing need for\\u00a0<strong>in-home care tailored to patients with complex neurological, immunological, and oncological conditions.<\\/strong> They understood that patients deserved more than basic home health visits\\u2014they deserved skilled care delivered with compassion and consistency.<\\/p><p>The name\\u00a0\\u201c<strong>Mobile Medical LA<\\/strong>\\u201d\\u00a0reflects the company\\u2019s mission: bringing high-quality clinical care to the patient, wherever they are. Over time we expanded our services across Southern California, specializing in managing long-term home infusions and supporting patients participating in clinical research.<\\/p><p>We are proud to be\\u00a0<strong>both home health certified and home infusion treatment (HIT) certified<\\/strong>\\u00a0\\u2014 a distinction that sets us apart in the industry. Being\\u00a0<strong>home health certified<\\/strong>\\u00a0means we meet stringent state and federal standards for providing skilled nursing and therapeutic services in the home setting. Our\\u00a0<em><strong>HIT certification<\\/strong><\\/em>\\u00a0confirms that we are qualified to safely administer complex medications, including biologics and immunoglobulins, with protocols that ensure patient safety and optimal outcomes.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"text_color\":\"#333333\",\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":12,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"section3\",\"elType\":\"sectio