ery clinician on our team is current with the latest protocols, safety standards, and patient care practices specific to IVIG.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"section4\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"_element_id\":\"content-research\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"80\",\"right\":\"30\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"30\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"column4\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b9d8265\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Clinical Research Support\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":36,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"title_color\":\"#0A3D62\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"30fd86e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#22A6B3\",\"weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":3,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"42fbe64\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>New drug therapies \\u2014 such as IVIG and other biologics \\u2014 are developed for highly specialized populations, often requiring precise administration methods. Mobile Medical LA plays a vital role in helping patients access these cutting-edge treatments by\\u00a0facilitating clinical trial participation. Our deep expertise in complex IVIG infusions directly informs our ability to execute clinical trial protocols with accuracy and care, ensuring continuity between investigational research and safe, effective home treatment.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"267d7b5\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"section5\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"_element_id\":\"content-trust\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"column5\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"section6\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"_element_id\":\"cta-section\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"column6\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(28945,1284,'_wp_page_template','default'),(28946,1284,'_elementor_version','3.28.2'),(28947,1284,'_elementor_pro_version','3.20.2'),(28953,1285,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(28954,1285,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(28955,1285,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"section1\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"_element_id\":\"hero-section\",\"background_background\":\"gradient\",\"background_gradient_angle\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":135},\"background_gradient_color\":\"#0a3d62\",\"background_gradient_color_stop\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":0},\"background_gradient_color_b\":\"#1e3799\",\"background_gradient_color_b_stop\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"100\",\"right\":\"30\",\"bottom\":\"100\",\"left\":\"30\",\"isLinked\":false},\"background_color\":\"#0A3D62\",\"background_color_b\":\"#1E3799\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"column1\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7cfaf6f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Where Complex Therapies Meet Compassionate Home Care\",\"header_size\":\"h1\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":48,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font