ological conditions. We recognized early on that IVIG administration isn\\u2019t one-size-fits-all, and our approach ensures\\u00a0<strong>every treatment is individualized, closely monitored, and supportive<\\/strong>\\u00a0of long-term health.<\\/p><p>To maintain the highest standards of care, our\\u00a0<strong>nurses receive additional, ongoing training and certifications<\\/strong>\\u00a0through the Immunoglobulin National Society (IGNS) and other professional organizations. This ensures that every clinician on our team is current with the latest protocols, safety standards, and patient care practices specific to IVIG.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"section4\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"_element_id\":\"content-research\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"80\",\"right\":\"30\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"30\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"column4\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b9d8265\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Clinical Research Support\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":36,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"title_color\":\"#0A3D62\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"30fd86e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#22A6B3\",\"weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":3,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"42fbe64\",\"elTyp