search.<\\/p><p>We are proud to be\\u00a0<strong>both home health certified and home infusion treatment (HIT) certified<\\/strong>\\u00a0\\u2014 a distinction that sets us apart in the industry. Being\\u00a0<strong>home health certified<\\/strong>\\u00a0means we meet stringent state and federal standards for providing skilled nursing and therapeutic services in the home setting. Our\\u00a0<em><strong>HIT certification<\\/strong><\\/em>\\u00a0confirms that we are qualified to safely administer complex medications, including biologics and immunoglobulins, with protocols that ensure patient safety and optimal outcomes.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"text_color\":\"#333333\",\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":12,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"section3\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"_element_id\":\"content-services\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#F5F6FA\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"80\",\"right\":\"30\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"30\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"column3\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"eb662b0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Specialized Services\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":36,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"title_color\":\"#0A3D62\",\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":32,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":24,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"6572407\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"align\":\"center\",\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#22A6B3\",\"weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"5a6babb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Our nurses are specially trained to\\u00a0<strong>administer intravenous immunoglobulin (IVIG) treatments<\\/strong>\\u00a0safely in the home\\u2014a complex therapy that requires clinical precision, experience, and a deep understanding of autoimmune and neurological conditions. We recognized early on that IVIG administration isn\\u2019t one-size-fits-all, and our approach ensures\\u00a0<strong>every treatment is individualized, closely monitored, and supportive<\\/strong>\\u00a0of long-term health.<\\/p><p>To maintain the highest standards of care, our\\u00a0<strong>nurses receive additional, ongoing training and certifications<\\/strong>\\u00a0through the Immunoglobulin National Society (IGNS) and other professional organizations. This ensures that every clinician on our team is current with the latest protocols, safety standards, and patient care practices specific to IVIG.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"section4\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"_element_id\":\"content-research\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"80\",\"right\":\"30\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"30\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"column4\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b9d8265\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Clinical Research Support\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":36,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"title_color\":\"#0A3D62\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"30fd86e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#22A6B3\",\"weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"42fbe64\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>New drug therapies \\u2014 such as IVIG and other biologics \\u2014 are developed for highly specialized populations, often requiring precise administration methods. Mobile Medical LA plays a vital role in helping patients access these cutting-edge treatments by\\u00a0facilitating clinical trial participation. Our deep expertise in complex IVIG infusions directly informs our ability to execute clinical trial protocols with accuracy and care, ensuring continuity between investigational research and safe, effective home treatment.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"267d7b5\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"section5\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"_element_id\":\"content-trust\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"column5\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"section6\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"_element_id\":\"cta-section\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"column6\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100},\