with\\u00a0<strong>principal investigators, contract research organizations (CROs), and the pharmaceutical industry<\\/strong>\\u00a0to deliver investigational drugs directly in the patient\\u2019s home. Our nurses are trained in <strong>following clinical trial protocols and regulatory compliance,<\\/strong> allowing research sponsors to conduct reliable studies in a patient\\u2019s home\\u2014without compromising data integrity or patient safety.<\\/p><p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">We believe that bringing research to the home isn\\u2019t just about convenience\\u2014it\\u2019s about expanding access, improving retention, and making breakthroughs possible.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]},\"text_color\":\"#333333\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"section5\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"_element_id\":\"content-trust\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#F5F6FA\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"80\",\"right\":\"30\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"30\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"column5\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2febfb5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Why Patients & Providers Trust Us\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":36,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"title_color\":\"#0A3D62\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"410809f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"align\":\"center\",\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#22A6B3\",\"weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"9b7a9d6\",\"elT