nts access these cutting-edge treatments by\\u00a0facilitating clinical trial participation. Our deep expertise in complex IVIG infusions directly informs our ability to execute clinical trial protocols with accuracy and care, ensuring continuity between investigational research and safe, effective home treatment.<\\/p><p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">We partner with\\u00a0<strong>principal investigators, contract research organizations (CROs), and the pharmaceutical industry<\\/strong>\\u00a0to deliver investigational drugs directly in the patient\\u2019s home. Our nurses are trained in <strong>following clinical trial protocols and regulatory compliance,<\\/strong> allowing research sponsors to conduct reliable studies in a patient\\u2019s home\\u2014without compromising data integrity or patient safety.<\\/p><p dir=\\\"ltr\\\">We believe that bringing research to the home isn\\u2019t just about convenience\\u2014it\\u2019s about expanding access, improving retention, and making breakthroughs possible.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]},\"text_color\":\"#333333\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"section5\",\"elType\":\"section\",\"settings\":{\"_element_id\":\"content-trust\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#F5F6FA\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"80\",\"right\":\"30\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"30\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"column5\",\"elType\":\"column\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":100},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"2febfb5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Why Patients & Providers Trust Us\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":36,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size