for patients in the comfort of their home. Home health care is more convenient, less expensive, and just as effective as the care received in the hospital or a nursing home. Our clinical team of highly trained nurses, therapists and other providers work with the patient, their family, and their physician on a personalized treatment plan. Based on the patient\'s needs, we provide specialty services, as well as care coordination, patient education on self-management, health promotion and disease prevention, medications, and lifestyle modifications for optimal wellness<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\"},\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\",\"ep_widget_cf_colors\":\"#D30C5C, #0EBCDC, #EAED41, #ED5A78, #DF33DF\",\"ep_widget_cf_shapes\":\"square|circle\",\"ep_widget_cf_shapes_emoji\":\"\\ud83c\\udf83|\\ud83c\\udf84|\\ud83d\\udc9c\",\"ep_widget_cf_shapes_svg\":\"M167 72c19,-38 37,-56 75,-56 42,0 76,33 76,75 0,76 -76,151 -151,227 -76,-76 -151,-151 -151,-227 0,-42 33,-75 75,-75 38,0 57,18 76,56z|M120 240c-41,14 -91,18 -120,1 29,-10 57,-22 81,-40 -18,2 -37,3 -55,-3 25,-14 48,-30 66,-51 -11,5 -26,8 -45,7 20,-14 40,-30 57,-49 -13,1 -26,2 -38,-1 18,-11 35,-25 51,-43 -13,3 -24,5 -35,6 21,-19 40,-41 53,-67 14,26 32,48 54,67 -11,-1 -23,-3 -35,-6 15,18 32,32 51,43 -13,3 -26,2 -38,1 17,19 36,35 56,49 -19,1 -33,-2 -45,-7 19,21 42,37 67,51 -19,6 -37,5 -56,3 25,18 53,30 82,40 -30,17 -79,13 -120,-1l0 41 -31 0 0 -41z|M449.4 142c-5 0-10 .3-15 1a183 183 0 0 0-66.9-19.1V87.5a17.5 17.5 0 1 0-35 0v36.4a183 183 0 0 0-67 19c-4.9-.6-9.9-1-14.8-1C170.3 142 105 219.6 105 315s65.3 173 145.7 173c5 0 10-.3 14.8-1a184.7 184.7 0 0 0 169 0c4.9.7 9.9 1 14.9 1 80.3 0 145.6-77.6 145.6-173s-65.3-173-145.7-173zm-220 138 27.4-40.4a11.6 11.6 0 0 1 16.4-2.7l54.7 40.3a11.3 11.3 0 0 1-7 20.3H239a11.3 11.3 0 0 1-9.6-17.5zM444 383