":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"7faf883\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p class=\\\"p1\\\">MMLA clinical research staff will coordinate and oversee the homecare nursing services from its corporate office located in Inglewood, California. MMLA will ensure the proper provision of services in accordance with the protocol, study contract and applicable regulations. A Home care Manager (Study Manager) will be assigned to the project in the U.S\\/Canada. MMLA complies with all applicable GCP and ICH guidelines and regulations, HIPAA and applicable federal, state and local regulations.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"text_color\":\"\"},\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\",\"ep_widget_cf_colors\":\"#D30C5C, #0EBCDC, #EAED41, #ED5A78, #DF33DF\",\"ep_widget_cf_shapes\":\"square|circle\",\"ep_widget_cf_shapes_emoji\":\"\\ud83c\\udf83|\\ud83c\\udf84|\\ud83d\\udc9c\",\"ep_widget_cf_shapes_svg\":\"M167 72c19,-38 37,-56 75,-56 42,0 76,33 76,75 0,76 -76,151 -151,227 -76,-76 -151,-151 -151,-227 0,-42 33,-75 75,-75 38,0 57,18 76,56z|M120 240c-41,14 -91,18 -120,1 29,-10 57,-22 81,-40 -18,2 -37,3 -55,-3 25,-14 48,-30 66,-51 -11,5 -26,8 -45,7 20,-14 40,-30 57,-49 -13,1 -26,2 -38,-1 18,-11 35,-25 51,-43 -13,3 -24,5 -35,6 21,-19 40,-41 53,-67 14,26 32,48 54,67 -11,-1 -23,-3 -35,-6 15,18 32,32 51,43 -13,3 -26,2 -38,1 17,19 36,35 56,49 -19,1 -33,-2 -45,-7 19,21 42,37 67,51 -19,6 -37,5 -56,3 25,18 53,30 82,40 -30,17 -79,13 -120,-1l0 41 -31 0 0 -41z|M449.4 142c-5 0-10 .3-15 1a183 183 0 0 0-66.9-19.1V87.5a17.5 17.5 0 1 0-35 0v36.4a183 183 0 0 0-67 19c-4.9-.6-9.9-1-14.8-1C170.3 142 105 219.6 105 315s65.3 173 145.7 173c5 0 10-.3 14.8-1a184.7 184.7 0 0 0 169 0c4.9.7 9.9 1 14.9 1 80.3 0 145.6-77.6 145.6-173s-65.3-173-145.7-173zm-220 138 27.4-40.4a11.6 11.6 0 0 1 16.4-2.7l54.7 40.3a11.3 11.3 0 0 1-7 20.3H239a11.3 11.3 0 0 1-9.6-17.5zM444 383.8l-43.7 17.5a17.7 17.7 0 0 1-13 0l-37.3-15-37.2 15a17.8 17.8 0 0 1-13 0L256 383.8a17.5 17.5 0 0 1 13-32.6l37.3 15 37.2-15c4.2-1.6 8.8-1.6 13 0l37.3 15 37.2-15a17.5 17.5 0 0 1 13 32.6zm17-86.3h-82a11.3 11.3 0 0 1-6.9-20.4l54.7-40.3a11.6 11.6 0 0 1 16.4 2.8l27.4 40.4a11.3 11.3 0 0 1-9.6 17.5z\",\"ep_notation_list\":[{\"_id\":\"f0b9b3f\",\"ep_notation_bracket_on\":\"left,right\"}],\"ep_sound_effects_element_selector\":\"my-header\",\"element_pack_widget_tooltip_text\":\"This is Tooltip\",\"ep_display_conditions\":[],\"ep_parallax_effects_transition_for\":\"all\",\"ep_parallax_effects_transition_duration\":\"100\",\"ep_parallax_effects_transition_easing\":\"linear\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_duration\":\"300\",\"element_pack_widget_effect_transition_easing\":\"ease-out\",\"text_color\":\"#7A7A7A\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"1047322\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"tabs\":[{\"tab_title\":\"More Information\",\"tab_content\":\"<p class=\\\"p1\\\">The Study Manager will ensure adequate training of all involved homecare study staff and will oversee study-related activities, timelines, adherence to budget, and quality assurance checks. MMLA will prepare a study-specific homecare training manual including study synopsis, clinician and nursing requirements, documentation, billing information and template of Physician Order Form.<\\/p><p class=\\\"p1\\\">The Study Manager will handle day-to-day interactions with the home care study personnel, the Sponsor \\/Investigator Site or Institution and their representatives. The Study Manager will provide status reports to the as mutually agreed upon (approximately weekly). MMLA will consolidate billings from each of the participating home care personel and will submit invoices to the Sponsor\\/Institution on a monthly basis. The Study Manager will be available 24\\/7 to respond to any issues arising during the course of the study.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"9495ebf\"}],\"title_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"title_typo