:\"<p class=\\\"p1\\\">The Study Manager will ensure adequate training of all involved homecare study staff and will oversee study-related activities, timelines, adherence to budget, and quality assurance checks. MMLA will prepare a study-specific homecare training manual including study synopsis, clinician and nursing requirements, documentation, billing information and template of Physician Order Form.<\\/p><p class=\\\"p1\\\">The Study Manager will handle day-to-day interactions with the home care study personnel, the Sponsor \\/Investigator Site or Institution and their representatives. The Study Manager will provide status reports to the as mutually agreed upon (approximately weekly). MMLA will consolidate billings from each of the participating home care personel and will submit invoices to the Sponsor\\/Institution on a monthly basis. The Study Manager will be available 24\\/7 to respond to any issues arising during the course of the study.<\\/p>\",\"_id\":\"9495ebf\"}],\"title_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"title_typography_font_family\":\"Poppins\",\"title_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"content_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"content_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"ha_advanced_tooltip_content\":\"I am a tooltip\",\"__globals__\":{\"content_color\":\"globals\\/colors?id=text\",\"title_color\":\"\"},\"ep_widget_cf_colors\":\"#D30C5C, #0EBCDC, #EAED41, #ED5A78, #DF33DF\",\"ep_widget_cf_shapes\":\"square|circle\",\"ep_widget_cf_shapes_emoji\":\"\\ud83c\\udf83|\\ud83c\\udf84|\\ud83d\\udc9c\",\"ep_widget_cf_shapes_svg\":\"M167 72c19,-38 37,-56 75,-56 42,0 76,33 76,75 0,76 -76,151 -151,227 -76,-76 -151,-151 -151,-227 0,-42 33,-75 75,-75 38,0 57,18 76,56z|M120 240c-41,14 -91,18 -120,1 29,-10 57,-22 81,-40 -18,2 -37,3 -55,-3 25,-14 48,-30 66,-51 -11,5 -26,8 -45,7 20,-14 40,-30 57,-49 -13,1 -26,2 -38,-1 18,-11 35,-25 51,-43 -13,3 -24,5 -35,6 21,-19 40,-41 53,-67 14,26 32,48 54,67 -11,