/sunset_bikes_IMG_3845.jpeg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(17,1,'2024-02-16 09:44:45','2024-02-16 09:44:45','','image-3','','inherit','open','closed','','image-3','','','2024-02-16 09:44:45','2024-02-16 09:44:45','',0,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/image-3.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(18,1,'2024-02-16 09:44:45','2024-02-16 09:44:45','','image-4','','inherit','open','closed','','image-4','','','2024-02-16 09:44:45','2024-02-16 09:44:45','',0,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/image-4.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(19,1,'2024-02-16 09:44:45','2024-02-16 09:44:45','','image-5','','inherit','open','closed','','image-5','','','2024-02-16 09:44:45','2024-02-16 09:44:45','',0,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/image-5.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(29,1,'2024-03-26 08:19:48','2024-03-26 08:19:48','','Home','','publish','closed','closed','','home','','','2025-03-31 11:14:11','2025-03-31 11:14:11','',0,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?page_id=29',0,'page','',0),(31,1,'2024-03-26 08:22:18','2024-03-26 08:22:18','','Default Kit','','publish','closed','closed','','default-kit','','','2025-04-01 10:28:15','2025-04-01 10:28:15','',0,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?p=31',0,'elementor_library','',0),(39,1,'2024-03-27 04:17:32','2024-03-27 04:17:32','<h1>About Us</h1>							\n								<figure><img src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/ACHC_HIT_exp-01-08-2026_rotated.pdf-1.jpeg\" alt=\"ACHC_HIT_exp-01-08-2026_rotated.pdf\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/mmla_lic.png\" alt=\"mmla_lic\" /></figure>			\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>					\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>					\n							<h2>Our Certification & Credibility</h2>		<p>MMLA offers home health, infusion, and research services. We are a staff of Skilled Nursing Clinicians that base our success on our patients\' long-term good health.</p><p>We believe in personalized care based on your health concerns.</p><p>To schedule an appointment,<br> please call: <a href=\"tel:(213) 545- MMLA (6652)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>(213) 545- MMLA (6652)</strong></a></p>								<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IJkc_FEi-fM\" target=\"_blank\">\n									ACHC Accreditation!\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/5D-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/5D-1.png 1920w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/5D-1-300x169.png 300w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/5D-1-1024x576.png 1024w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/5D-1-768x432.png 768w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/5D-1-1536x864.png 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />																<h2>Our Mission</h2>		<p>We are committed to advancing the practice of home infusion nursing through continuous education, innovation, and adherence to the highest standards of safety and care. Our goal is to empower patients to live more independently and joyfully, minimizing the disruption to their lives and fostering a positive healing environment. The heart of our mission lies in our belief that everyone deserves access to quality healthcare services that respect their dignity, preferences, and unique needs.</p>								<a href=\"tel:(213)%20545-MMLA\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Schedule Appointment\n					</a>\n									<h2>Our Vision</h2>		<p>We envision a future where every individual requiring infusion therapy can access top-tier, personalized nursing care in the sanctuary of their own home, surrounded by the comfort and support of their loved ones. Our aim is to extend our reach, ensuring that no patient is left behind due to geographical, physical, or socioeconomic barriers.</p>													<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/6E.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/6E.jpg 1920w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/6E-300x169.jpg 300w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/6E-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/6E-768x432.jpg 768w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/6E-1536x864.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />																<h1>Call to Action: (213) 545-6652</h1>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Schedule a Consultation\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/refer-a-patient/\">\n									Refer a Patient\n					</a>','About Us','','publish','closed','closed','','about-us','','','2025-05-07 21:35:26','2025-05-07 14:35:26','',0,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?page_id=39',0,'page','',0),(41,1,'2024-03-27 04:17:50','2024-03-27 04:17:50','<h1>Our Services</h1>							\n																	<img width=\"1000\" height=\"667\" src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/9f7f86eec3.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/9f7f86eec3.jpeg 1000w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/9f7f86eec3-300x200.jpeg 300w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/9f7f86eec3-768x512.jpeg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" />																<h2>Home Health Services</h2>		<p>We provide a range of clinical and support services for patients in the comfort of their home. Home health care is more convenient, less expensive, and just as effective as the care received in the hospital or a nursing home. Our clinical team of highly trained nurses, therapists and other providers work with the patient, their family, and their physician on a personalized treatment plan. Based on the patient\'s needs, we provide specialty services, as well as care coordination, patient education on self-management, health promotion and disease prevention, medications, and lifestyle modifications for optimal wellness</p>					\n							<h2>HIT Services</h2>		<p>We provide a range of clinical and support services for patients in the comfort of their home. Home health care is more convenient, less expensive, and just as effective as the care received in the hospital or a nursing home. Our clinical team of highly trained nurses, therapists and other providers work with the patient, their family, and their physician on a personalized treatment plan. Based on the patient\'s needs, we provide specialty services, as well as care coordination, patient education on self-management, health promotion and disease prevention, medications, and lifestyle modifications for optimal wellness</p>					\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">More Information</a>\n					<p>Mobile Medical LA works with major pharmacies to increase the quality of patient care and reduce hospital stays and readmissions. We offer flexible contracts to meet the needs of every patient, physician, and healthcare network. Our services include but are not limited to:</p><ul><li>Total Parental Nutrition (TPN)</li><li>Antibiotics</li><li>Pain Management</li><li>Immunoglobulin (IVIG)</li><li>Hydration</li><li>Antiemetic</li><li>Antiviral Therapy</li><li>Antifungal Therapy</li><li>Injectables</li></ul>\n												<a href=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/#1\">\n									ACHC certified for HIT\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/7D.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/7D.jpg 1920w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/7D-300x169.jpg 300w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/7D-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/7D-768x432.jpg 768w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/7D-1536x864.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />																		\n																	<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/8F.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/8F.jpg 1920w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/8F-300x169.jpg 300w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/8F-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/8F-768x432.jpg 768w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/8F-1536x864.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />																<h2>Clinical Trials support services</h2>		<p>MMLA clinical research staff will coordinate and oversee the homecare nursing services from its corporate office located in Inglewood, California. MMLA will ensure the proper provision of services in accordance with the protocol, study contract and applicable regulations. A Home care Manager (Study Manager) will be assigned to the project in the U.S/Canada. MMLA complies with all applicable GCP and ICH guidelines and regulations, HIPAA and applicable federal, state and local regulations.</p>					\n															<svg viewBox=\"0 0 192 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M0 384.662V127.338c0-17.818 21.543-26.741 34.142-14.142l128.662 128.662c7.81 7.81 7.81 20.474 0 28.284L34.142 398.804C21.543 411.404 0 402.48 0 384.662z\"></path></svg>\n								<svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M288.662 352H31.338c-17.818 0-26.741-21.543-14.142-34.142l128.662-128.662c7.81-7.81 20.474-7.81 28.284 0l128.662 128.662c12.6 12.599 3.676 34.142-14.142 34.142z\"></path></svg>\n												<a tabindex=\"0\">More Information</a>\n					<p>The Study Manager will ensure adequate training of all involved homecare study staff and will oversee study-related activities, timelines, adherence to budget, and quality assurance checks. MMLA will prepare a study-specific homecare training manual including study synopsis, clinician and nursing requirements, documentation, billing information and template of Physician Order Form.</p><p>The Study Manager will handle day-to-day interactions with the home care study personnel, the Sponsor /Investigator Site or Institution and their representatives. The Study Manager will provide status reports to the as mutually agreed upon (approximately weekly). MMLA will consolidate billings from each of the participating home care personel and will submit invoices to the Sponsor/Institution on a monthly basis. The Study Manager will be available 24/7 to respond to any issues arising during the course of the study.</p>\n							<h1>Call to Action: (213) 545-6652</h1>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Schedule a Consultation\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/refer-a-patient/\">\n									Refer a Patient\n					</a>','Our Services','','publish','closed','closed','','our-services','','','2025-05-07 21:22:44','2025-05-07 14:22:44','',0,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?page_id=41',0,'page','',0),(43,1,'2024-03-27 04:18:12','2024-03-27 04:18:12','<style>/*! elementor - v3.20.0 - 26-03-2024 */<br />\r\n.elementor-heading-title{padding:0;margin:0;line-height:1}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title[class*=elementor-size-]>a{color:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-small{font-size:15px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-medium{font-size:19px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-large{font-size:29px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xl{font-size:39px}.elementor-widget-heading .elementor-heading-title.elementor-size-xxl{font-size:59px}</style>\r\n<h2>Coming Soon!</h2>','Partners','','publish','closed','closed','','partners','','','2024-03-27 07:32:07','2024-03-27 07:32:07','',0,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?page_id=43',0,'page','',0),(46,1,'2024-03-27 04:18:37','2024-03-27 04:18:37','<h1>Our Resources</h1>		https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5BhXLu3zMoQhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fz5QuBGZIZUhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WJVVYk1sg0Ihttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e0beW0LfFGohttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fmrt-6E-ufYhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iZ_r5ztWa4k&#038;t=36shttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KL24UudgYtUhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dhv4haxM_1Qhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bhO7re7lOQI			<h1>More Resources? Click here:</h1>										<a href=\"https://www.cms.gov/medicare/payment/fee-for-service-providers/home-infusion-therapy\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Home Infusion Therapy (CMS.gov)\n					</a>','Resources','','publish','closed','closed','','re