css\">		<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 384 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M172.268 501.67C26.97 291.031 0 269.413 0 192 0 85.961 85.961 0 192 0s192 85.961 192 192c0 77.413-26.97 99.031-172.268 309.67-9.535 13.774-29.93 13.773-39.464 0zM192 272c44.183 0 80-35.817 80-80s-35.817-80-80-80-80 35.817-80 80 35.817 80 80 80z\"></path></svg>						\n										6818 South La Cienega Blvd. #203 Inglewood, CA 90302\n									</li>\n								<li>\n											<a href=\"tel:%20(213)%20545-6652\">\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M497.39 361.8l-112-48a24 24 0 0 0-28 6.9l-49.6 60.6A370.66 370.66 0 0 1 130.6 204.11l60.6-49.6a23.94 23.94 0 0 0 6.9-28l-48-112A24.16 24.16 0 0 0 122.6.61l-104 24A24 24 0 0 0 0 48c0 256.5 207.9 464 464 464a24 24 0 0 0 23.4-18.6l24-104a24.29 24.29 0 0 0-14.01-27.6z\"></path></svg>						\n										Office: (213) 545-6652\n											</a>\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M480 160V77.25a32 32 0 0 0-9.38-22.63L425.37 9.37A32 32 0 0 0 402.75 0H160a32 32 0 0 0-32 32v448a32 32 0 0 0 32 32h320a32 32 0 0 0 32-32V192a32 32 0 0 0-32-32zM288 432a16 16 0 0 1-16 16h-32a16 16 0 0 1-16-16v-32a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16zm0-128a16 16 0 0 1-16 16h-32a16 16 0 0 1-16-16v-32a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16zm128 128a16 16 0 0 1-16 16h-32a16 16 0 0 1-16-16v-32a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16zm0-128a16 16 0 0 1-16 16h-32a16 16 0 0 1-16-16v-32a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16zm0-112H192V64h160v48a16 16 0 0 0 16 16h48zM64 128H32a32 32 0 0 0-32 32v320a32 32 0 0 0 32 32h32a32 32 0 0 0 32-32V160a32 32 0 0 0-32-32z\"></path></svg>						\n										Fax: (877) 845-6050\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n		<p>Appointment Request</p><p>We typically have same-day appointment or staffing availability.</p><p>Call <a href=\"tel:(213) 545-MMLA (6652)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>(213) 545-MMLA (6652)</strong></a> for prompt scheduling.</p><p>New Patients</p><p>All new patients receive a complimentary one-hour consult with our head clinician to establish a personalized care plan.</p><p>Health Insurance</p><p>We accept most public and private insurance plans. We also offer special pricing for cash-paying patients for most procedures.</p>[forminator_form id=\"472\"]','Contact Us','','publish','closed','closed','','contact-us','','','2024-03-27 07:53:35','2024-03-27 07:53:35','',0,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?page_id=50',0,'page','',0),(53,1,'2025-03-31 18:15:03','2024-03-27 04:26:50',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','53','','','2025-03-31 18:15:03','2025-03-31 18:15:03','',0,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?p=53',4,'nav_menu_item','',0),(54,1,'2025-03-31 18:15:03','2024-03-27 04:26:50',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','54','','','2025-03-31 18:15:03','2025-03-31 18:15:03','',0,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?p=54',2,'nav_menu_item','',0),(55,1,'2025-03-31 18:15:03','2024-03-27 04:26:50',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','55','','','2025-03-31 18:15:03','2025-03-31 18:15:03','',0,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?p=55',3,'nav_menu_item','',0),(59,1,'2024-03-27 04:28:00','2024-03-27 04:28:00','','_2018_04_01_mmla_logo-removebg-preview','','inherit','open','closed','','_2018_04_01_mmla_logo-removebg-preview','','','2024-03-27 04:28:00','2024-03-27 04:28:00','',0,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/2018_04_01_mmla_logo-removebg-preview.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(84,1,'2024-03-27 05:10:57','2024-03-27 05:10:57','','MMA1','','inherit','open','closed','','mma1','','','2024-03-27 05:10:57','2024-03-27 05:10:57','',29,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/MMA1.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(127,1,'2024-03-27 05:25:59','2024-03-27 05:25:59','','_ACHC_MMLA_Certificate_HIT_exp-01-08-2025_page-0001','ACHC','inherit','open','closed','','_achc