eo.					</p>\n							<h2>Why Patients &amp; Providers Trust Us</h2>		<ul style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px; font-family: Verdana;\"><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Specialized in Complex Care – Experts in IVIG, biologics, and clinical research nursing</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Certified &amp; Compliant – Home health and infusion certified, fully licensed, and HIPAA-compliant</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Trusted by Top Partners – Chosen by leading physicians, specialty pharmacies, CROs, and pharma companies</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Compassion Meets Clinical Precision – Every visit combines advanced training with personalized attention</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Serving All of Southern California – Deep community roots with fast, reliable in-home care coverage</p></li></ul>			<h3>Ready to Refer a Patient or Learn More?</h3>		<h2 style=\"--theme-font-weight: 500; --theme-font-size: 35px; --theme-line-height: 1.5; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 500; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; letter-spacing: normal; text-transform: none; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Refer a patient: (213) 545- MMLA (6652)</h2><p>Schedule a consultation: <a href=\"tel:(213) 545- MMLA (6652)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>(213) 545- MMLA (6652)</strong></a></p>','Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','29-revision-v1','','','2025-03-30 19:16:16','2025-03-30 19:16:16','',29,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?p=1219',0,'revision','',0),(1220,1,'2025-03-30 19:17:45','2025-03-30 19:17:45','<h2><h2 style=\"--theme-font-weight: 500; --theme-font-size: 35px; --theme-line-height: 1.5; fon