trained in <strong>following clinical trial protocols and regulatory compliance,</strong> allowing research sponsors to conduct reliable studies in a patient’s home—without compromising data integrity or patient safety.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">We believe that bringing research to the home isn’t just about convenience—it’s about expanding access, improving retention, and making breakthroughs possible.</p>			<h2>Why Patients & Providers Trust Us</h2>							\n				<ul><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Specialized in Complex Care – Experts in IVIG, biologics, and clinical research nursing</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Certified &amp; Compliant – Home health and infusion certified, fully licensed, and HIPAA-compliant</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Trusted by Top Partners – Chosen by leading physicians, specialty pharmacies, CROs, and pharma companies</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Compassion Meets Clinical Precision – Every visit combines advanced training with personalized attention</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Serving All of Southern California – Deep community roots with fast, reliable in-home care coverage</p></li></ul>','New Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','1234-revision-v1','','','2025-04-01 08:09:32','2025-04-01 08:09:32','',1234,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?p=1327',0,'revision','',0),(1329,1,'2025-04-01 09:57:27','2025-04-01 09:57:27','','Default Kit','','inherit','closed','closed','','31-revision-v1','','','2025-04-01 09:57:27','2025-04-01 09:57:27','',31,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?p=1329',0,'revision','',0),(1330,1,'2025-04-01 10:02:07','2025-04-01 10:02:07','','Default Kit','','inherit','closed','closed','','31-revision-v1','','','2025-04-01 10:02:07','2025-04-01 10:02:07','',31,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?p=1330',0,'revision','',0),(1331,1,'2025-04-01 10:04:01','2025-04-01 10:04:01','','Default Kit','','inherit',