 latest protocols, safety standards, and patient care practices specific to IVIG.</p>			<h2>Pioneers in Clinical Research at Home</h2>							\n				<p>New drug therapies — such as IVIG and other biologics — are developed for highly specialized populations, often requiring precise administration methods. Mobile Medical LA plays a vital role in helping patients access these cutting-edge treatments by facilitating clinical trial participation. Our deep expertise in complex IVIG infusions directly informs our ability to execute clinical trial protocols with accuracy and care, ensuring continuity between investigational research and safe, effective home treatment.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">We partner with <strong>principal investigators, contract research organizations (CROs), and the pharmaceutical industry</strong> to deliver investigational drugs directly in the patient’s home. Our nurses are trained in <strong>following clinical trial protocols and regulatory compliance,</strong> allowing research sponsors to conduct reliable studies in a patient’s home—without compromising data integrity or patient safety.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">We believe that bringing research to the home isn’t just about convenience—it’s about expanding access, improving retention, and making breakthroughs possible.</p>			<h2>Why Patients & Providers Trust Us</h2>							\n				<ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; margin-left: 0;\"><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Specialized in Complex Care – Experts in IVIG, biologics, and clinical research nursing</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Certified &amp; Compliant – Home health and infusion certified, fully licensed, and HIPAA-compliant</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Trusted by Top Partners – Chosen by leading physicians, specialty pharmacies, CROs, and pharma companies</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Compassion Meets Clinical Precision – Every visit combines advanced training with personalized attention</p></li><li dir=\"ltr\"><p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Serving All of Southern California – Deep community roots with fast, reliable in-home care coverage</p></li></ul>','New Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','1234-revision-v1','','','2025-04-01 11:17:54','2025-04-01 11:17:54','',1234,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?p=1346',0,'revision','',0),(1347,1,'2025-04-01 11:17:54','2025-04-01 11:17:54','<h1>Where Complex Therapies Meet Compassionate Home Care</h1>					<h3>Providing personalized home infusion services and research-ready nursing support across California</h3>					<h2>About Mobile Medical LA</h2>							\n				<p>Founded in 2017 in the heart of Los Angeles, <strong>Mobile Medical LA</strong> is a vision of expert home health nurses who saw the growing need for <strong>in-home care tailored to patients with complex neurological, immunological, and oncological conditions.</strong> They understood that patients deserved more than basic home health visits—they deserved skilled care delivered with compassion and consistency.</p><p>The name “<strong>Mobile Medical LA</strong>” reflects the company’s mission: bringing high-quality clinical care to the patient, wherever they are. Over time we expanded our services across Southern California, specializing in managing long-term home infusions and supporting patients participating in clinical research.</p><p>We are proud to be <strong>both home health certified and home infusion treatment (HIT) certified</strong> — a distinction that sets us apart in the industry. Being <strong>home health certified</strong> means we meet stringent state and federal standards for providing skilled nursing and therapeutic services in the home setting. Our <em><strong>HIT certification</strong></em> confirms that we are qualified to safely administer complex medications, including biologics and immunoglobulins, with protocols that ensure patient safety and optimal outcomes.</p>			<h2>Specialized