eous_780x470-300x181.jpg 300w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/HIT_Subcutaneous_780x470-768x463.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 780px) 100vw, 780px\" />																										<img width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/hizentra-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/hizentra-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/hizentra-300x169.jpg 300w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/hizentra-768x432.jpg 768w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/hizentra.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />																<h1>Call to Action:</h1>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Schedule a Consultation\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"#\">\n									Refer a Patient\n					</a>','New Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','1234-revision-v1','','','2025-04-01 18:09:03','2025-04-01 18:09:03','',1234,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?p=1457',0,'revision','',0),(1458,1,'2025-04-01 18:09:03','2025-04-01 18:09:03','<h1>Where Complex Therapies Meet Compassionate Home Care</h1>					<h3>Providing personalized home infusion services and research-ready nursing support across California</h3>					<h2>About Mobile Medical LA</h2>							\n				<p>Founded in 2017 in the heart of Los Angeles, <strong>Mobile Medical LA</strong> is a vision of expert home health nurses who saw the growing need for <strong>in-home care tailored to patients with complex neurological, immunological, and oncological conditions.</strong> They understood that patients deserved more than basic home health visits—they deserved skilled care delivered with compassion and consistency.</p><p>The name “<strong>Mobile Medical LA</strong>” reflects the company’s mission: bringing high-quality clinical care to the patient, wherever they are. Over time we expanded our services across Southern California, specializing in managin