nical trial protocols and regulatory compliance,</strong> allowing research sponsors to conduct reliable studies in a patient’s home—without compromising data integrity or patient safety.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">We believe that bringing research to the home isn’t just about convenience—it’s about expanding access, improving retention, and making breakthroughs possible.</p>			<h2>Why Patients & Providers Trust Us</h2>							\n									<ul>\n							<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Specialized in Complex Care – Experts in IVIG, biologics, and clinical research nursing\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Compliant – Home health and infusion certified, fully licensed, and HIPAA-compliant\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Compassion Meets Clinical Precision – Every visit combines advanced training with personalized attention\n									</li>\n								<li>\n							<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M173.898 439.404l-166.4-166.4c-9.997-9.997-9.997-26.206 0-36.204l36.203-36.204c9.997-9.998 26.207-9.998 36.204 0L192 312.69 432.095 72.596c9.997-9.997 26.207-9.997 36.204 0l36.203 36.204c9.997 9.997 9.997 26.206 0 36.204l-294.4 294.401c-9.998 9.997-26.207 9.997-36.204-.001z\"></path></svg>						\n										Serving All of Southern California – Deep community roots with fast, reliable in-home care coverage\n									</li>\n						</ul>\n																	<img width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/preparing-for-injection-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/preparing-for-injection-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/preparing-for-injection-300x200.jpg 300w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/preparing-for-injection-768x512.jpg 768w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/preparing-for-injection-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/preparing-for-injection-2048x1365.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />																										<img width=\"780\" height=\"470\" src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/HIT_Subcutaneous_780x470.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/HIT_Subcutaneous_780x470.jpg 780w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/HIT_Subcutaneous_780x470-300x181.jpg 300w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/HIT_Subcutaneous_780x470-768x463.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 780px) 100vw, 780px\" />																										<img width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/hizentra-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/hizentra-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/hizentra-300x169.jpg 300w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/hizentra-768x432.jpg 768w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/hizentra.jpg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />																<h1>Call to Action: (213) 545-6652</h1>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Schedule a Consultation\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/refer-a-patient/\">\n									Refer a Patient\n					</a>','New Home','','inherit','closed','closed','','1234-revision-v1','','','2025-05-07 20:24:24','2025-05-07 13:24:24','',1234,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?p=1635',0,'revision','',0),(1636,1,'2025-05-07 20:27:21','2025-05-07 13:27:21','<h1>About Us</h1>							\n								<figure><img src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/ACHC_HIT_exp-01-08-2026_rotated.pdf-1.jpeg\" alt=\"ACHC_HIT_exp-01-08-2026_rotated.pdf\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/mmla_lic.png\" alt=\"mmla_lic\" /></figure>			\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>					\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>					\n							<h2>Our Certification & Credibility</h2>		<p>MMLA offers home health, infusion, and research services. We are a staff of Skilled Nursing Clinicians that base our success on our patients\' long-term good health.</p><p>We believe in personalized care based on your health concerns.</p><p>To schedule an appointment,<br> please call: <a href=\"tel:(213) 545- MMLA (6652)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>(213) 545- MMLA (6652)</strong></a></p>								<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IJkc_FEi-fM\" target=\"_blank\">\n									ACHC Accreditation!\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/5D-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/5D-1.png 1920w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/5D-1-300x169.png 300w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/5D-1-1024x576.png 1024w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/5D-1-768x432.png 768w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/5D-1-1536x864.png 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />																<h2>Our Mission</h2>		<p>We are committed to advancing the practice of home infusion nursing through continuous education, innovation, and adherence to the highest standards of safety and care. Our goal is to empower patients to live more independently and joyfully, minimizing the disruption to their lives and fostering a positive healing environment. The heart of our mission lies in our belief that everyone deserves access to quality healthcare services that respect their dignity, preferences, and unique needs.</p>								<a href=\"tel:(213)%20545-MMLA\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Schedule Appointment\n					</a>\n									<h2>Our Vision</h2>		<p>We envision a future where every individual requiring infusion therapy can access top-tier, personalized nursing care in the sanctuary of their own home, surrounded by the comfort and support of their loved ones. Our aim is to extend our reach, ensuring that no patient is left behind due to geographical, physical, or socioeconomic barriers.</p>													<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/6E.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/6E.jpg 1920w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/6E-300x169.jpg 300w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/6E-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/6E-768x432.jpg 768w, https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/6E-1536x864.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px\" />																<h1>Call to Action: (213) 545-6652</h1>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Schedule a Consultation\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/refer-a-patient/\">\n									Refer a Patient\n					</a>','About Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','39-revision-v1','','','2025-05-07 20:27:21','2025-05-07 13:27:21','',39,'https://mobilemedicalla.com/?p=1636',0,'revision','',0),(1637,1,'2025-05-07 20:27:21','2025-05-07 13:27:21','<h1>About Us</h1>							\n								<figure><img src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/ACHC_HIT_exp-01-08-2026_rotated.pdf-1.jpeg\" alt=\"ACHC_HIT_exp-01-08-2026_rotated.pdf\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mobilemedicalla.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/mmla_lic.png\" alt=\"mmla_lic\" /></figure>			\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>					\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"